{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Sans\n🦴 Character returning from Undertale; settles in Hometown together with his younger brother Papyrus right before the game begins.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/86374-and-sans-undertale-black-line-white-sprite.png","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":190,"height":190},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Papyrus**\nHis younger brother, with whom he settles in Hometown right before the game begins.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Toriel**\nBecomes friends with her the night before the game begins; Ch.5 confirms that closeness by showing them dancing together at the end of the Festival.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nGives them a fake phone number as a joke, and in Ch.5 is the one who gets the ice cream needed to convince Susie and Noelle to go to the Lake — a small, quiet push toward the climax of the…","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Undertale Connection**\nHe's one of the characters returning directly from Undertale, with his design, voice, and sense of humor practically intact.","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Does he stop the ferris wheel halfway to hide the Lake?**\nConfirmed by the game itself: the narration explicitly says \"*the ferris wheel only went up halfway*\" [TODO: verify exact EN quote], and whoever went —Susie or Noelle, depending on who's sent to ride— comments afterward \"*I wish you could have seen the…*\" [TODO: verify exact EN quote]","x":-680,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Did he arrive in Hometown from another dimension?**\nThe strongest theory about Sans: his \"abrupt and unnatural\" arrival in Hometown —which neither Kris nor Susie remember witnessing— would fit with the implication that Sans used his old lab (from Undertale) to…","x":-680,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Is it the Weird/Sword Route that \"produces\" or unlocks Undertale?**\nTaking the route all the way to the end (including the Twisted Sword) might be the necessary step to finally meet Gaster — with a more extreme variant placing Deltarune *before* Undertale.","x":-680,"y":770,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"**Why doesn't Papyrus appear?**\nSans mentions him from Ch.1 on, but he never appears in person — he's only heard behind the door. Could be tied to the same inherited workshop/lab research.","x":-340,"y":770,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Papyrus_sprite1.webp","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":107,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Toriel_Overworld.webp","x":420,"y":-470,"width":91,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":420,"y":10,"width":240,"height":146},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Undertale.png","x":-130,"y":270,"width":180,"height":180},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/sans_lab_machine_another_universe.png","x":-974,"y":-313,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s7-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/sans_knows_something_take_it_easy.png","x":-354,"y":1126,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s_puertas","type":"text","text":"**🎲 The Goner doors and Sans's shortcut**\nGaster's machine, the teleporting Goner doors, and the gray door at Fun 66 could be the same technology — and explain Sans's shortcuts.","x":700,"y":-850,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_puertas-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/sans_door_theory.webp","x":700,"y":-1150,"width":220,"height":190},{"id":"s_pan","text":"**🎲 The bread and the Mother glitch**\nThe \"Bread\" item in Sans's shop could be a nod to the real Bread Crumbs Glitch from Mother/EarthBound, the series that influenced Toby Fox the most.","type":"text","x":700,"y":300,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_pan-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/sans_bread_mother.png","x":700,"y":560,"width":220,"height":190}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e5_x2","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s5-img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s7-img","fromNode":"s7-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s7","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_puertas","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_puertas","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_puertas-img","fromNode":"s_puertas-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_puertas","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_pan","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_pan","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_pan-img","fromNode":"s_pan-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s_pan","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_papyrus_whynoappear","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_ferris_dimension","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_dimension_ruta","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_undertale_dimension","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_puertas_dimension","fromNode":"s_puertas","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s5","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_pan_undertale","fromNode":"s_pan","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_ruta_undertale","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"3"}]}